    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Neo Zodiac Has Arrived!</strong></h2>8 Conjurers with their 8 creature types battle for control of the Zodiac.<br>Defeat a Conjurer: their constellation and creatures are yours, plus hybrids of your own!<br>Your Zodiac of cards and creatures will continue to expand.<br>Aquarius the immortal waits at the center of the Zodiac.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><strong>Innovative blend of Cards + Terrain Tactics:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play cards <u>on the map</u>: creature cards on summoning circles, ability cards on creatures and spells on the terrain.<br></li><li>Terrain affects the power, movement and utility of all creatures.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/extras/a8f46fbe8db1b6cb95ad94fe639e84ba.poster.avif?t=1749770279\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/extras/a8f46fbe8db1b6cb95ad94fe639e84ba.webm?t=1749770279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/extras/a8f46fbe8db1b6cb95ad94fe639e84ba.mp4?t=1749770279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Complete Zodiac of 60 Animated Creatures and Hybrids:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Humans, Prowlers, Hoofed beasts, Winged beasts, Lizards, Serpents, Polypods.<br></li><li>A Hoofed-Human is a Minotaur, an Polypod-Prowler is a Manticore, and a Winged-Lizard is a Dragon.<br></li><li>Each creature levels up and can be used in numerous battles!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/extras/1f44c40a3760d46cca1e31cb21774652.poster.avif?t=1749770279\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/extras/1f44c40a3760d46cca1e31cb21774652.webm?t=1749770279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/extras/1f44c40a3760d46cca1e31cb21774652.mp4?t=1749770279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>150 Cards and Deck Builder:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose weapon and spell cards that match your favorite creature's special abilities.<br></li><li>Prepare your deck to counter each opponent and contest their advantageous battlefield.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/extras/ed6694a36d782a13a25facde565d097e.poster.avif?t=1749770279\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/extras/ed6694a36d782a13a25facde565d097e.webm?t=1749770279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/extras/ed6694a36d782a13a25facde565d097e.mp4?t=1749770279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Challenging computer opponent; helpful tooltips and tutorial:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lv.1 computer opponent attacks simply, Lv.3 uses spell combos and long-game advantages, Lv.5 thinks about every card and creature combination, <i>and</i> what order to use them in. You'll need luck-of-the-draw at this level!<br></li><li>Tutorial and help menu: learn the rules in around 10 minutes.<br></li><li>Three intense boss battles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/extras/b937dcf3afee6f0ff85b388e6a4446c1.poster.avif?t=1749770279\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/extras/b937dcf3afee6f0ff85b388e6a4446c1.webm?t=1749770279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/extras/b937dcf3afee6f0ff85b388e6a4446c1.mp4?t=1749770279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>",
